#H
#C(168,005)|Tutorial|
#F015
#L(016,050)|The aim of Warlords is to utterly destroy|
#L(016,070)|every other player in the game!|
#L(016,090)|You can do this chiefly by making sure they|
#L(016,110)|have no cities left.|
#F007
#L(016,135)|This tutorial is a very small scenario dealing|
#L(016,155)|with the battle for the Isle of Tutoria|
#L(016,175)|between the Knights and the evil Darklords.|
#F015
#L(016,200)|There are a total of 6 cities and 6 ruins|
#L(016,220)|here, and only 2 players - a normal game of|
#L(016,240)|Warlords has 8 players, 40 ruins, and 80 cities.|
#F007
#L(016,265)|At certain points of the game, screens like|
#L(016,285)|this one will appear to help you.|
#L(016,305)|Farewell then... and good luck!|
#E

